      <chord name="Dm/A"/>Allelu-ia! <chord name="F/C"/>sing <chord name="Gm"/>to <chord name="F/C"/>Jesus! <chord name="C"/>His <chord name="Am"/>the <chord name="Bb"/>scepter, <chord name="F/C"/>His <chord name="Dm/A"/>the <chord name="C"/>throne;<br/>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>Allelu-ia! <chord name="F/C"/>Histhe <chord name="C7"/>triumph, <chord name="F/C"/>His <chord name="Dm/A"/>the <chord name="C"/>victory <chord name="F/C"/>alone;<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Hark! <chord name="Dm/A"/>the <chord name="Am"/>songs of peaceful <chord name="Gm"/>Sion Thunder <chord name="Am"/>like a <chord name="Dm"/>might-y <chord name="D7"/>flood;<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>Jesus <chord name="Am"/>out of <chord name="Gm/D"/>every <chord name="F"/>nation Hath <chord name="Edim"/>redeemed <chord name="Gbdim"/>us <chord name="Am"/>by <chord name="Gm/D"/>His blood.
      </lines>
